    "Box 2 has more people (5), so it should count more. We use a **weighted** average:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{weighted gini} = \\frac{3}{8} \\times 0 + \\frac{5}{8} \\times 0.32 = 0 + 0.2 = \\mathbf{0.2}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "0.2 is much lower than 0.5. This is a **good** question."
